OL,5,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe interceptors pursue an
OL,7,     Fout-of-control motorbike and a
OL,8,     Fpetrol thief attempts to destroy
OL,9,     Fhis ill-gotten gains.
OL,10,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,11,     FThe police dog unit is called into
OL,12,     Faction to chase a thief. The
OL,13,     Fpursuit of a Range Rover leads to
OL,14,     Fa haul of stolen cars.
OL,15,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,16,     FAt West Orchards, Paige receives
OL,17,     Fan SOS from a new store that a
OL,18,     Fdastardly duo are back. And Farrah
OL,19,     Fis on the case of a pair who work
OL,20,     Ftogether to hit a small
OL,21,     Fconvenience store. (Ep12)
