OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThe casualty department is full,
OL,7,     Fbut ambulances are still bringing
OL,8,     Fin critically ill patients,
OL,9,     Fincluding a husband who was found
OL,10,     Fcollapsed on the floor.
OL,11,G2100 999: Killer On The Line
OL,12,     FFive years after the unexpected
OL,13,     Fdeath of his girlfriend in 2006,
OL,14,     FRobert Trigg calls 999 to report
OL,15,     Fanother unexplained death - that
OL,16,     Fof his new girlfriend.
OL,17,G2200 999: Critical Condition
OL,18,     FDocumentary series following the
OL,19,     Fwork of a major hospital trauma
OL,20,     Funit. David is rushed in after
OL,21,     Fbeing attacked with a machete.
