OL,5,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,6,     FDr Dev needs a delicate hand to
OL,7,     Favoid a crucial nerve on a
OL,8,     Fpatient's forehead; there's a
OL,9,     Fmessy neck cyst for Dr Emma; and
OL,10,     FTeanna asks Dr Natalia to examine
OL,11,     Fa lump caused by a pony bite.
OL,12,G0000 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,13,G     Death
OL,14,     FReturn of the series in which
OL,15,     Flife-saving and life-changing
OL,16,     Foperations involve split-second
OL,17,     Fdecisions. Sajid has a massive
OL,18,     Faneurysm. If it bursts, he will
OL,19,     Fbleed to death.
